# One identity-free list is previewed and merged; no logbook or own-climb rows.
NAV START: BoardBrowser .* ClimbDetail\(
loadClimb complete \([0-9a-f-]+\)
NAV COMPLETE: BoardClimbDetail\([0-9a-f-]+\)
DataExchangeVM: event=import_preview board_sends=0 board_bids=0 climb_lists=1 pubkey_mismatch=false
DataExchangeVM: event=import_complete board_sends=0 board_bids=0 climb_lists=1 own_climbs=0 skipped=0 mismatch_override=false
